["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"18. 商业口述史：从美国往事，到Google输掉OpenAI第一局 money follows eyeball Transformer Alphabet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-14-zhangxiaojun-雅虎当年拒绝收购谷歌-因为不信搜索能做大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsPR31QYmhX6JZwU7xJr_bu8YECQ.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0314</span></div>\n<h2>雅虎当年拒绝收购谷歌，因为不信搜索能做大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雅虎和宝洁都犯过同一个错：不相信搜索会走到前台、不相信美国人会坐在街边喝星巴克。创始人过早退到二线，公司就失去了赌一把的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商业口述史</span><span class=\"tag\">谷歌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"17.【趋势2023】沉闷的港股会好吗、富豪的家办与苦恼 Family Office Trustee Boy Leverage Insurance PI客户 Long Only\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-03-zhangxiaojun-家族办公室比家族还多-香港的财富管理时代才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjKb7BehSq1GpltsiF_nANOkSSS2.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0303</span></div>\n<h2>家族办公室比家族还多，香港的财富管理时代才刚开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">港股从14000点反弹50%只是情绪修复，真正的新趋势是香港从Fintech转向Wealth Management——但家办门槛低到没有牌照要求，鱼龙混杂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">港股</span><span class=\"tag\">家族办公室</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"16.【趋势2023】那些挣到钱、消失的互联网中高层去哪了 Individual Contributor stakeholder social listening vintage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-02-16-zhangxiaojun-互联网中高层出走率接近三分之二-但这不是年龄问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuAtpP_ili9G9VPdreUekpHfmqvW.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0216</span></div>\n<h2>互联网中高层出走率接近三分之二，但这不是年龄问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网二十年高增长靠技术红利和用户红利，红利掩盖了管理能力的缺失；今天组织膨胀变成内耗，出走是行业自我校正，而不是35岁危机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网</span><span class=\"tag\">职业经理人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"14. 香港的语言政策、暧昧和青年迷思 两文三语 微调教学语言 吴庆瑞报告书 特选学校 Burlister liberal studies\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-31-zhangxiaojun-香港两文三语只有3-到5-的人能做到-这是个失败的政策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FruysRIpMNHG2_DGTT-wNDHjgW0M.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0131</span></div>\n<h2>香港两文三语只有3%到5%的人能做到，这是个失败的政策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香港坚持一个只有3%到5%的人能达到的语言政策目标，而新加坡用50年、三代人完成了从双语并重到英文为主的转向，代价是消灭方言和压制反对派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港</span><span class=\"tag\">语言政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"13. 邮轮小史，去寻找海面上的乌托邦 White Star old money freestyle godmother\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-20-zhangxiaojun-邮轮巨头靠并购做大-为造船收购船厂的那家破产了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgdnQM-6zKrLAzISh0PAKSyYZwL-.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0120</span></div>\n<h2>邮轮巨头靠并购做大，为造船收购船厂的那家破产了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">嘉年华几十年里把白星、冠达这些老牌公司一家家买下来，最多时手上约100条船；云顶为了造20万吨巨轮去收购德国船厂，资金被套在里面，最后破产。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">邮轮</span><span class=\"tag\">旅游业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"12. 和黄宇翔聊东南亚另5国：小国的扈从和对冲 hedging multi-directional reconciliation The Art of Not Being Governed\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-16-zhangxiaojun-小国不站队-东南亚五国的对冲术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhw1_-Xyew_-qhNzavC2KVW7nqiE.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0116</span></div>\n<h2>小国不站队：东南亚五国的对冲术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">缅甸、老挝、柬埔寨、文莱、东帝汶这五个小国，很少一边倒，而是农业靠一家、国防靠另一家，用多向量外交在大国之间做对冲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">东南亚</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"11. 新加坡的淘金热和政商环境 Token2049 Terra FTX 淡马锡 沙盒\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-09-zhangxiaojun-新加坡不是-web3-中心-只是全球淘金者的避难所/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhAYZhgfXSTUbLORz3u_HGGL3U4a.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>新加坡不是 Web3 中心，只是全球淘金者的避难所</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新加坡政府从 2010 年就给官员发比特币做实验，但它体量太小、技术人员太少，注定只能当枢纽而非中心。真正值钱的是它用企业方式运作政府、给创业公司报销 70% 参展费的那套机制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新加坡</span><span class=\"tag\">Web3</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"6. 显微镜下的硅谷大裁员：一笔笔现实经济账 Level.FYI Cobra H1B P&amp;L IC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-11-21-zhangxiaojun-meta-裁员补偿-4-n-2-有绿卡是幸福-没绿卡是倒计时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e62e38accb0559-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 裁员补偿 4+N/2：有绿卡是幸福，没绿卡是倒计时</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一场 Meta 裁员，有绿卡的人拿着十几万美金去新公司上班，没绿卡的人要在四个月内、还是节假日窗口里找到下一份工作，否则就得离开美国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷裁员</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"3. 宇航员与机器人：漫谈深邃浪漫的ROBOT新知 in-hand manipulation DARPA Robotic Challenge silver bullet product market fit DLR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-10-zhangxiaojun-让机器人削个土豆就能当院士-这比登火星更难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd4230dec43e1a9d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">58:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>让机器人削个土豆就能当院士，这比登火星更难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">登火星的技术人类大部分已经有了，只是个经济问题；但怎么让机器人在厨房里工作，人类现在还不知道，甚至还没有思路——谁能让机器人削个土豆，可以当院士。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"2. 和曹巍聊聊马斯克、机器人恐怖谷和《西部世界》 uncanny valley iToF SLAM 力控\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-10-03-zhangxiaojun-人形机器人最难的环节不是走路-是穿针剥虾/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2834a742a2c9e6e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">55:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>人形机器人最难的环节不是走路，是穿针剥虾</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">双足行走和自主导航都能沿袭特斯拉自动驾驶的积累，精准力控和触觉不能——那要模拟人的皮肤，开车时根本用不到。第一版、第二版机器人大概只到人的 20% 到 30%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"1. 和投资人梦秋聊聊加州、投资寒潮和林黛玉 Bubble Burst 持币待购\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-07-11-zhangxiaojun-资本寒冬不是缺钱-是大家都在持币待购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e3f2f9d0bed1e26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">54:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0711</span></div>\n<h2>资本寒冬不是缺钱，是大家都在持币待购</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「资本寒冬」每两三年就被喊一次，通常六到八个月就过去。这次不一样：两头在外的美元通路被打断，不是没钱，而是不知道该怎么投。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一级市场</span><span class=\"tag\">资本寒冬</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"串台《硅谷101》｜TikTok如何在Facebook眼皮底下成长起来？ UP 值 UG 中台 Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-16-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-在-facebook-眼皮底下长大-靠的不是产品而是体系/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/83f0cc536109ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">38:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 在 Facebook 眼皮底下长大，靠的不是产品而是体系</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">字节赢在体系而非个人：推荐算法、UG 中台、商业化三套系统叠加 Musical.ly 的产品壳，再用对标 Facebook 的 UP 值打法下狠手投放，才跑出全球第五大社交应用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（下集） UG PMO GDPR All-Hands Meeting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-05-05-zhangxiaojun-不留空档全面压制-tiktok-花-100-亿美元砸出护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3c064d7b78c0bb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">45:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0505</span></div>\n<h2>不留空档全面压制：TikTok 花 100 亿美元砸出护城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 全球化的第一推力是钱和一条暗号：几年间投入约 100 亿美元买量、补贴内容、砸服务器，对手要拦至少得准备 200 到 300 亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字节跳动</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"《TikTok内幕：张一鸣的巨浪征途》音频版（上集） ARPU Lasso\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-04-29-zhangxiaojun-tiktok-曾是-facebook-最尊贵的客户-直到日活破亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/297c1019274060ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">35:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0429</span></div>\n<h2>TikTok 曾是 Facebook 最尊贵的客户，直到日活破亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">TikTok 早期最重要的投放渠道是 Facebook，推广预算每个季度增长 100% 以上；Facebook 认定它留存太差、留不住用户，反而把流量导给它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">TikTok</span>\n</div></div></a>"]